_em_entity_assembly.id                   1 
_em_entity_assembly.parent_id            0 
_em_entity_assembly.details              
;The optimized coding DNAs for human hASIC1a (Uniprot: P78348) was synthesized by GeneScript. The truncated hASIC1a (with the carboxyl terminal 60 residues removed, named as hASIC1a-DeltaC) was cloned into the pFastBac1 vector (Invitrogen) with 8-His tag at the amino terminus. Baculovirus-infected Sf9 cells (Thermo Fisher) were used for overexpression and were grown at 300K in serum-free SIM SF medium (Sino Biological Inc.).
The mambalgin1 (Mamba1) toxin was obtained using a hydrazide-based chemical synthesis method.
;
_em_entity_assembly.name                 hASIC1a-Mamba1 
_em_entity_assembly.source               'MULTIPLE SOURCES' 
_em_entity_assembly.type                 COMPLEX 
_em_entity_assembly.entity_id_list       '1, 2' 
_em_entity_assembly.synonym              ? 
_em_entity_assembly.oligomeric_details   ? 
