_em_specimen.id                      1 
_em_specimen.experiment_id           1 
_em_specimen.concentration           3.1 
_em_specimen.details                 
;The purified hASIC1a protein in a buffer comtaining 20 mM Tris (pH 8.0), 200 mM NaCl, 0.05% DDM, 0.01% CHS concentrated to about 5 mg/ml based on A280 measurement, using a 100-kDa cutoff Centricon (Millipore). The chemical synthesized, lyophilized Mamba1 was dissolved in buffer containing 20 mM Tris (pH 8.0), 200 mM NaCl, 0.05% DDM, 0.01% CHS at a final concentration of 10 mg/ml based on A280 measurement, and added in a 6:1 molar ratio of toxin to hASIC1a channel with incubation for 1 h at 297K.
;
